{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063895/block/singleImage/3267791/df/01M7FEZ5YY61VVV906SAFYJ83E.jpg?updatedAt=1794741707\"/><figcaption>綠表客189萬購朗屏邨一房 19年勁升18倍｜二手公屋成交</figcaption></figure><p>綠表客積極入市，中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗朗屏邨悦屏樓低層 34 室，單位實用面積約 355 方呎，一房間隔。原叫價 210 萬元，日前以未補價 189 萬元沽出，呎價約 5,324 元。 王勤學透露，買家為綠表上車客，心儀朗屏邨交通及起居方便，加上單位開則實用，睇樓後迅速決定入市上址。據了解，原業主於 2007 年以未補價 9.81 萬元買入單位，持貨約 19 年轉手，物業期內帳面升值約 179.19 萬元或 18.3 倍。 資料顯示，朗屏邨位於朗屏朗屏路 1 號， 1989 年入伙，共有 15 座，提供 8,491 伙。</p><p>即睇元朗朗屏邨放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063895/block/singleImage/3267796/wm/01M7FF0M538MFAGTZVD6M0ZC4F.JPG?updatedAt=1794741707\"/><figcaption>朗屏邨於1989年入伙，共有15座，提供8,491伙。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:21.044022+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T20:49:42.326450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:43.375894+00:00","content_hash":"193e537be980d6e88ddec9c89c55a6c2c664b38fea8f89ca7e1457aef5b0cd1c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:21.044022+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}